==== MakeUpType ====
Specifies the location of make up. All list of make up locations you can find in "media\lua\shared\Definitions\MakeUpDefinitions.lua"
<syntaxhighlight lang="Java">
MakeUpType = Lips,
</syntaxhighlight>

